      "content": "I understand your hesitation to see a doctor due to costs, but it's crucial to prioritize your health and well-being. The risks of taking st. John's wort while on hormonal contraception are significant, as these supplements can decrease the effectiveness of birth control pills and lead to unintended pregnancies. Trustworthy healthcare professionals can offer personalized advice based on your specific situation. Your health is invaluable, and their expertise is often worth the cost for peace of mind and safety.",
